OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally, a fine and dry start
OL,6,Fto the day with the odd mist and fog
OL,7,Fpatch clearing rapidly. Turning cloudy
OL,8,Fat times, particularly during the
OL,9,Fafternoon but plenty of good sunny
OL,10,Fspells likely and feeling warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine and dry evening with
OL,13,Fsunny spells. Dry overnight but
OL,14,Fclouding over from the west with clear
OL,15,Fintervals lingering longest towards
OL,16,Fthe east. Muggy overnight,
OL,17,Fparticularly for London.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
