OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,6,Flight rain developing during the
OL,7,Fmorning and continuing through the
OL,8,Fperiod, but many areas remaining dry.
OL,9,FFeeling warm and muggy particularly in
OL,10,Furban areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FMostly dry and partly cloudy for the
OL,14,Fnext few days, although the odd light
OL,15,Fshower is possible. Feeling warm in
OL,16,Fthe sun and muggy by night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
